{"4220840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yet Another Jumping Game", "steam_appid": 4220840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yet Another Jumping Game</strong> is a ragebait, platformer with garbageware aesthetic. It's a game that might remind you of other games with similar names to these: Getting Over It with What's His Name?, Sexy Hitchhiking, or Jump Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TL;DR</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The story is that you must jump to find fun.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Character progression includes upgrades and jumping higher.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Game mechanics include jumping and a single, looping song if you choose to listen to it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playtime depends on skill, but could be up to undefined infinity hours or more of jumping.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a 2D, Precision, Platformer where you jump, and likely, fall.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jump Counter, Height Counter, and Text-Based Comments from the Character are included.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yet Another Jumping Game</strong> is a ragebait, platformer with garbageware aesthetic. It's a game that might remind you of other games with similar names to these: Getting Over It with What's His Name?, Sexy Hitchhiking, or Jump Emperor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TL;DR</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The story is that you must jump to find fun.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Character progression includes upgrades and jumping higher.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Game mechanics include jumping and a single, looping song if you choose to listen to it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Playtime depends on skill, but could be up to undefined infinity hours or more of jumping.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a 2D, Precision, Platfor